<title>HUNGARY: Hungary March ind output down 8.6 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Hungary March ind output down 8.6 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final figures confirmed Hungary's industrial output in March fell 8.6 percent over February but revised year-on-year increase was 3.3 percent, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>KSH's preliminary figures showed a fall of 8.6 percent month-on-month and a rise of 3.6 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>In February industrial output rose 2.4 percent month-on-month and was 6.8 percent up year-on-year.  </p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT</p>
<p>     (Pct change)   March 1997    Feb 1996    March 1996</p>
<p>  Month-on-month	-8.6	     +2.4	 -6.2</p>
<p>  Year-on-year	  +3.3 (+3.6)    +6.8	 -1.6</p>
<p>Note. Data in brackets was preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
